# The address of a static whose initialiser lies outside verus!; it
# claims only that every call returns the same nodes.
root	allocator invariant	Verus
# `VERSION_STR`, whose definition lies outside verus!; it claims only that
# the value is a `&'static str`.
VERSION	core library	none (assumption)
# Temporary seams, discharged by lane 45b, which verifies `thread_heap`
# (after 50b verifies `heap::heap_for_thread`): the `thread.*` readers.
thread_allocated	allocator invariant	Verus
thread_allocatedp	allocator invariant	Verus
thread_deallocated	allocator invariant	Verus
thread_deallocatedp	allocator invariant	Verus
